[I] A blazingly fast Slack TUI

[T] A blazingly fast Slack TUI. Keyboard-driven, beautifully themed, and
[T] under 20MB. One static binary. No Electron required.

[U] https://github.com/gammons/slk

[A] Grant Ammons <grant@grant.dev>
[M] NoTag <notag@t2sde.org>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS
[R] + arm arm64 loongarch64 mips mips64 powerpc64 riscv64 s390x x86 x86-64

[L] MIT
[V] 0.42.1

[D] f0c242239d7b0e465c925f5b800a0462a60476a0fc9f9734f9bdc142 slk-0.42.1.tar.gz https://github.com/gammons/slk/archive/v0.42.1/

